    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "批量时钟扫描补丁被指与缓冲区替换重构混在一起",
      "summary": "Greg Burd 的补丁把批量 clock sweep 优化和缓冲区替换的大改放在一起，包含移除 ring buffer 策略。Andres Freund 和 Ants Aasma 指出他把 ring 策略讲错了：bulkwrite 的用意是让发起大量写入的后端自己承担写出、形成反压，StrategyRejectBuffer 只对 bulkread 生效。两人也质疑基准，pgbench -S 的 IO 形态太单一。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CANwKhkNSfSts=psKPBYk3CL+0QYkqzFjUpmTv-Hyq+e9RQTY7w@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Greg Burd",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-22",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "缓冲区",
        "性能"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Supabase 把逻辑复制包装成托管 Pipelines",
      "summary": "Supabase Pipelines 进入公开 alpha，用 PostgreSQL 逻辑复制和开源的 Supabase ETL 引擎，先对发布中的表做一次初始同步，之后持续捕获插入、更新、删除和 truncate。文档给出每条管线的小时费与按 GB 计的同步和复制费，服务运行在 AWS eu-central-1，官方标明是 alpha。托管 CDC 省掉自建连接器的运维面，也把复制能力和故障域绑在平台上。",
      "url": "https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/replication/pipelines",
      "author": "Supabase",
      "source": "Supabase 文档",
      "source_date": "2026-07-21",
      "image": "https://obuldanrptloktxcffvn.supabase.co/functions/v1/og-images?site=docs&amp%3Btype=database&amp%3Btitle=Set+up+Pipelines&amp%3Bdescription=Create+a+Supabase+Pipeline+using+Postgres+logical+replication.",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "逻辑复制",
